infographic sequence-timeline-simple
data
  title Debounce boundary: prove the contract at 799 / 800 ms
  desc The 799-then-1 pattern pins fires-once, at-the-deadline, never-early
  sequences
    - label Type the draft text
      desc Debounce armed; fake clock frozen at 0 ms
    - label Advance 799 ms
      desc saveSpy NOT called — nothing fires early
    - label Advance +1 ms to 800 ms
      desc saveSpy called exactly once — fires at the deadline
    - label Contract pinned
      desc Fires once, at 800 ms — never merely eventually
theme
  palette #6366f1 #14b8a6 #f59e0b #10b981
